    "detailed_description": "Following the runaway success of Blaston, VR\u2019s biggest dueling competition, streamers and sports fans alike can now view matches from the comfort of their PC with the Blaston Spectator App!<br><br>Created with the audience perspective in mind, the Blaston Spectator app gives users access to helpful broadcast tools designed to enhance the viewing experience.<br><br><strong><u>Features:</u></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Spectate specific matches using Blaston\u2019s existing room code system<br></li><li>Follow an entire Knockout Tournament using the tournament code system<br></li><li>Choose from multiple camera angles to follow the action in the best way possible<br></li><li>Access broadcast-quality overlays including selected weapons layouts, health statistics and more</li></ul><br>Want to be the star of the show as well as a streamer? Be sure to add the full Blaston experience to your Steam Library today!<br><br>",
    "about_the_game": "Following the runaway success of Blaston, VR\u2019s biggest dueling competition, streamers and sports fans alike can now view matches from the comfort of their PC with the Blaston Spectator App!<br><br>Created with the audience perspective in mind, the Blaston Spectator app gives users access to helpful broadcast tools designed to enhance the viewing experience.<br><br><strong><u>Features:</u></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Spectate specific matches using Blaston\u2019s existing room code system<br></li><li>Follow an entire Knockout Tournament using the tournament code system<br></li><li>Choose from multiple camera angles to follow the action in the best way possible<br></li><li>Access broadcast-quality overlays including selected weapons layouts, health statistics and more</li></ul><br>Want to be the star of the show as well as a streamer? Be sure to add the full Blaston experience to your Steam Library today!<br><br>",
    "short_description": "View and stream Blaston matches with broadcast-quality tools so that your audience never has to miss a moment of the action! Built with streamers and esports fans in mind, Blaston Spectator gives PC owners everything they need to keep an eye on the action of VR\u2019s hottest competitive dueling game.",
